author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: "The documented local coverage command exits non-zero on the same condition the hosted threshold step rejects; The failure message names the files below threshold and their uncovered lines, so a contributor can act without opening a CI log; The threshold values have a single declared source shared by the local command and the hosted step, rather than being restated in each; A negative control proves the local command can fail on a deliberately uncovered branch"
parent: pm-u9d0
risk: high
confidence: high
resolution: fixed
expected_result: "All acceptance criteria are satisfied with local, manual, and hosted evidence."
actual_result: "Local and hosted merged coverage fail on any uncovered integer count or malformed report; all four partial shards feed the exact merged gate; 438 files and 6,888 tests pass at exact 100/100/100/100."
